%% T-5: persistence & recovery — journal write path and room rebuild.
%% Update when: snapshot trigger, join branches, or journal layout change.
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Room (lock)
    participant D as Document
    participant J as IOpJournal
    participant RS as Redis Stream / snap key

    Note over R,J: write path — every op, under the room lock
    C->>R: Submit(op)
    R->>R: dedup (clientId,clientSeq)
    R->>D: apply, seq=N
    R->>J: Append(op N)
    J->>RS: XADD doc:{id}:ops (MAXLEN ~10k)
    alt every 100 ops
        R->>J: WriteSnapshot(seq=N, doc.Snapshot())
        J->>RS: SET doc:{id}:snap {seq,json}
    end
    R-->>C: broadcast + ack

    Note over R,RS: restart — room rebuild
    R->>J: LoadSnapshot()
    J->>RS: GET doc:{id}:snap
    R->>D: Restore(json, snapSeq) — registers at seq=snapSeq
    R->>J: ReadSince(FirstSeq-1) — ALL surviving ops
    J->>RS: XRANGE doc:{id}:ops
    loop each op
        R->>D: Apply — LWW no-op if seq<=snapSeq
        R->>R: rebuild _ackIndex/_lastClientSeq — dedup survives restart
    end

    Note over C,R: join branches
    C->>R: Join(lastSeq)
    alt FirstSeq <= lastSeq <= room LastSeq
        R-->>C: ops since lastSeq
    else lastSeq below journal base OR in the future
        R-->>C: snapshot + ops since snapSeq
    end
